# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env (it is git-ignored).
#
# Keys REQUIRED by the POS scripts (scripts/env.js --check lists any missing):
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_DB_URL=
OWNER_EMAIL=
OWNER_PASSWORD=

# KEY RULES
#  * scripts/env.js reads ONLY this file. It never falls back to any other
#    credentials file, and it never prints a value.
#  * Only SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, OWNER_EMAIL and OWNER_PASSWORD are
#    ever compiled into the APK (--dart-define whitelist in scripts/env.js and
#    scripts/build_apk.sh).
#  * SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and SUPABASE_DB_URL are server/script-only and
#    must NEVER be passed to a build.
